       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GREETER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY GREETWS.
       01  WS-MESSAGE          PIC X(40).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM BUILD-GREETING
           PERFORM SHOW-GREETING
           CALL 'LOGGER' USING WS-MESSAGE
           STOP RUN.
       BUILD-GREETING.
           MOVE 'WORLD' TO WS-NAME
           STRING 'HELLO, ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
                  INTO WS-MESSAGE.
       SHOW-GREETING.
           DISPLAY WS-MESSAGE.
